# Smart Irrigation System

## Aim
Automatically water plants when the soil becomes dry.

## Components
- Arduino Uno
- Soil Moisture Sensor
- Relay Module
- Water Pump
- Jumper Wires

## Working
The soil moisture sensor checks the moisture level.
When the soil is dry, Arduino activates the pump.
When sufficient moisture is detected, the pump turns off.

## Features
- Automatic irrigation
- Saves water
- Reduces manual work
- Simple Arduino-based system

## Technologies
- Arduino
- C/C++
- Sensors
- Automation
